{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":true,"allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"confidence":{"const":"unknown"}}},"then":{"required":["reason","probe","cost"]}}],"description":"The --json form of a `nar ask` answer: the Part 0.1 Answer Contract as a document. Every answer carries a direct answer, concrete evidence citations, a confidence from the fixed mapping, a reasoning chain (WHY), the serving chain (CHAIN) and a boundary. When confidence is unknown, reason (from the closed taxonomy), probe and cost are additionally required.","properties":{"answer":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"boundary":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"case_dir":{"type":"string"},"chain":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"confidence":{"enum":["confirmed","strongly-indicated","inferred","unknown"],"type":"string"},"cost":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"evidence":{"items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"intent":{"enum":["identity","build","screens","behaviour","storage","network","security","monetisation","assets","animation","scripts","rebuild","compare","gaps","other"],"type":"string"},"probe":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"question":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"reason":{"enum":["encrypted","unsupported-codec","server-side","stripped","absent"],"type":"string"},"target":{"type":"string"},"why":{"items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["question","intent","answer","evidence","confidence","why","chain","boundary"],"title":"NAR ask answer document (Part 7)","type":"object"}